{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45433","headline":"九月十五日夜宿郑尚书絪东亭望月寄杜给事 · 广宣","name":"九月十五日夜宿郑尚书絪东亭望月寄杜给事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜天晴夜宿东斋，松竹交阴惬素怀。\n迥出风尘心得地，可怜三五月当阶。\n清光满院恩情见，寒色临门笑语谐。\n霄汉路殊从道合，往来人事不相乖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"广宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}